      "text": "The company delivered a 3-year PAT CAGR of 40.1% and revenue CAGR of 14.9% while expanding operating margin from 51.2% to 55.2%.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Quarterly revenue grew sequentially from ₹52,145 Cr in Sep 2025 to ₹58,539 Cr in Jun 2026, with PAT rising from ₹8,651 Cr to ₹10,012 Cr over the same period.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Operating cash flow to PAT ratio of 3.75 over three years indicates strong cash conversion relative to earnings.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Debt to equity of 1.31 is flagged as high leverage, raising balance sheet risk.",
