       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Multiple management targets — including 4-5% ARPU growth over 5-7 years, ₹20,000 Cr capex over 5 years, 1 GW data center capacity in 3-4 years, 30-35% household penetration, and Nxtra AI efficiency gains — remain unverified with zero quarters of delivery tracked.",
